<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>cut-and-sew</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/cut-and-sew.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/polos.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <section class="hero-section">
        <div class="hero-bg-container">
            <img src="../photos/embroidery.webp" alt="Vito and Will folded polo shirts" class="hero-image">
        </div>

    </section>
    <section class="manufacturing-services">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Custom Embroidery Manufacturers Premium Apparel Decoration</h2>

            <p class="section-text">
                Embroidery has been a timeless craft since the 7th century, elevating garments with style, class, and
                durability. At Wuzwear Industry, we bring this art into modern apparel manufacturing by offering custom
                embroidery services for a wide variety of products, including T-shirts, polos, sweatshirts, hoodies,
                pants, jeans, shorts, and more.



            </p>

            <p class="section-text">
                Whether you’re a private label brand, sports team, or corporate business, our embroidery factory can
                bring your designs to life with precision and quality. With us, you get much more than just
                stitching—you get tailored embroidery decoration that makes your apparel stand out.



            </p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="service-row">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/embroidery1.webp" alt="Close up of hands using a sewing machine">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">Reliable Custom Embroidered Apparel Services</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        We make embroidery simple and convenient for businesses of all sizes. Our skilled team delivers
                        affordable, high-quality embroidery with quick turnaround times.


                    </p>
                    <p>From logo embroidery for uniforms to custom embroidered sportswear and activewear, we provide you
                        with a range of solutions to grow your brand. Plus, you can easily create a private label
                        embroidery clothing line, adding a touch of sophistication and exclusivity to your garments.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-row row-reverse">
                <div class="service-image">
                    <img src="../photos/embroidery2.webp" alt="Tailor working with denim fabric at a workbench">
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h2 class="service-title">High-Quality Embroidery Manufacturing for Best Results</h2>
                    <p class="service-text">
                        Our professionals use state-of-the-art digitizing technology and advanced machines to deliver
                        impeccable embroidery. With the right balance of thread tension, bobbin tightness, and sharp
                        detailing, your designs always look flawless.


                    </p>
                    <p>Every embroidered piece is carefully checked by our quality assurance team to guarantee accuracy,
                        durability, and a polished finish. Whether it’s a bulk run of corporate polos or limited-edition
                        streetwear, we deliver consistent results every time.

                    </p>

                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="dye-services-section">
        <div class="container">

            <div class="dye-row">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/embroidery3.webp" alt="Colorful sublimated and dyed athletic t-shirts">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Embroidery Patches Flexible Branding Solutions</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Not all garments are suitable for direct embroidery. That’s why custom embroidered patches are a
                        great solution. They can be stitched or heat-applied to any product, reducing thread heaviness
                        on lightweight fabrics while still keeping the embroidery bold and durable.


                    </p>
                    <p>We can craft custom-shaped patches for jackets, hats, uniforms, and more—giving you versatile
                        options for branding and personalization.

                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dye-row row-reverse">
                <div class="dye-image">
                    <img src="../photos/embroidery4.webp"
                        alt="A collection of vibrant fabric color swatches arranged together">
                </div>
                <div class="dye-content">
                    <h2 class="dye-title">Raised or 3D Embroidery Bold & Premium Finishing</h2>
                    <p class="dye-text">
                        Looking to make your design pop? Our 3D puff embroidery is the best choice. This technique adds
                        depth and prominence to your logo or artwork, making it ideal for caps, hoodies, and
                        sweatshirts.


                    </p>
                    <p>Unlike regular flat embroidery, 3D embroidery gives your apparel a bold, textured look that truly
                        grabs attention.

                    </p>
                    <a href="#" class="trigger-popup-btn btn-quote">Get a Qoute</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>


<%- include('partials/popup') %>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>